  "prefLabel": "Tra 205.04 Processing of the Petition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 205.04 Processing of the Petition.\n\n(a) Upon receipt of a petition for rulemaking, the commissioner shall proceed in accordance with RSA 541-A:4.\n\n(b) The petition shall be granted, and a rulemaking proceeding shall be initiated pursuant to RSA 541-A, if the commissioner finds that the requested action is consistent with state and federal law and policy.\n\nSource. #7927-A, eff 7-26-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra200.html"
}
